[[build-voidstar]]
=== Voidstar format and schema strings

**STUB**: Specifies voidstar, the language-neutral binary layout every
serialized value takes: the layout of each primitive, string, array, tuple,
record, optional and sum type, along with alignment and the rules for nested
data. Defines the schema string grammar that describes a layout, and how a
schema and a buffer together let any language read a value with no other type
information.

